 "tickets_note": "No public source exposes remaining-ticket counts for these events without an API key. Ticketmaster Discovery API (free key, 5k calls/day) returns event status (onsale/offsale/cancelled), on-sale dates and sometimes price ranges, but not seats remaining. Inventory-level data (SeatGeek Platform API needs a client_id; StubHub/viagogo and Ticketmaster Partner/Inventory APIs need partner approval) shows resale listing counts/prices, not primary stock. Club/venue shops (PSG, Paris FC, Stade de France, Accor Arena, Roland-Garros) show only 'complet'/'dernières places' flags in HTML, and scraping them is usually against their terms. Practical keyless proxy: treat 'sold out' signals from official news pages plus the historical fill rates in this file as the availability estimate."
}